@startuml cu10
!theme plain
title CU10 — Eliminar cliente

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to delete a client.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (First name; Last name; Identification type and number)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the search data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Looks up and presents a list of clients.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects a client and confirms the deletion.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Deletes the selected client.
System -> System : System

@enduml